Data attribution
================

This project reads the GTFS feed "Telangana opendata GTFS TGSRTC" published by
Open Data Telangana (https://data.telangana.gov.in/) for the Telangana State
Road Transport Corporation (TGSRTC).

Licence of the data: the maintainer uses the feed under a free, worldwide,
non-exclusive licence for use, adaptation and redistribution of the data and
derived works. This reflects the maintainer's understanding of the publisher's
open-data terms; it has not been separately confirmed in writing with the
publisher. If you rely on the data, check the terms on the publisher's dataset
page yourself. Attribution to the publisher (Open Data Telangana / TGSRTC) is
given in the site footer and here.

The feed itself is NOT included in this repository.

